<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<section xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" id="fs-id1170655163482">
<title>Mengidentifikasi dan Menggabungkan Suku-suku Sejenis</title><para id="fs-id1170655355506">Bentuk aljabar tersusun atas suku-suku. <emphasis effect="bold">Suku</emphasis> adalah konstanta, atau hasil kali suatu konstanta dengan satu atau beberapa variabel.</para>
<note id="fs-id1170655355510">
<title>Suku</title>
<para id="fs-id1170655081102"><term id="term-00019">Suku</term> adalah konstanta, atau hasil kali suatu konstanta dengan satu atau beberapa variabel.</para>
</note>
<para id="fs-id1170655106479">Contoh suku adalah <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mtext>dan</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:msup><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
<para id="fs-id1170654944550">Konstanta yang mengalikan variabel disebut <emphasis effect="bold">koefisien</emphasis>.</para>
<para id="fs-id1171789962795"><newline /><newline /></para>
<note id="fs-id1170654944554">
<title>Koefisien</title>
<para id="fs-id1170655190285"><term id="term-00020">Koefisien</term> suatu suku adalah konstanta yang mengalikan variabel dalam suku tersebut.</para>
</note>
<para id="fs-id1170655108012">Anggaplah koefisien sebagai bilangan di depan variabel. Koefisien suku 3<emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis> adalah 3. Ketika kita menulis <emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis>, koefisiennya adalah 1 karena <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
<example id="fs-id1170654958635">
<exercise id="fs-id1170654958637">
<problem id="fs-id1170654958640">
<para id="fs-id1170655199112">Identifikasi koefisien setiap suku: <span class="token">ⓐ</span> 14<emphasis effect="italics">y</emphasis> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>15</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓒ</span> <emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis>.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655353600">
<title>Penyelesaian</title>
<para id="fs-id1166425225066"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> Koefisien 14<emphasis effect="italics">y</emphasis> adalah 14.<newline /><newline />
<span class="token">ⓑ</span> Koefisien <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>15</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> adalah 15.<newline /><newline />
<span class="token">ⓒ</span> Koefisien <emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis> adalah 1 karena <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</example>
<note id="fs-id1170654942248" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170654942251">
<problem id="fs-id1170654942254">
<para id="fs-id1170654942256">Identifikasi koefisien setiap suku: <span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>17</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>41</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓒ</span> <emphasis effect="italics">z</emphasis>.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170654943070">
<para id="fs-id1170654943072"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> 17 <span class="token">ⓑ</span> 41 <span class="token">ⓒ</span> 1</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id1170654941712" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170654941715">
<problem id="fs-id1170654941718">
<para id="fs-id1170654941720">Identifikasi koefisien setiap suku: <span class="token">ⓐ</span> 9<emphasis effect="italics">p</emphasis> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>13</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓒ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170654941893">
<para id="fs-id1170654941895"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> 9 <span class="token">ⓑ</span> 13 <span class="token">ⓒ</span> 1</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<para id="fs-id1170654944001">Beberapa suku memiliki ciri yang sama. Perhatikan 6 suku berikut. Suku mana yang tampaknya memiliki ciri yang sama?</para>
<equation id="fs-id1170655066427" class="unnumbered"><label /><m:math><m:mrow><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mtd><m:mtd /><m:mtd /><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd /><m:mtd /><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:msup><m:mi>n</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mtd><m:mtd /><m:mtd /><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd /><m:mtd /><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mtd><m:mtd /><m:mtd /><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>n</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:mrow></m:math></equation>
<para id="fs-id1170654943858">Baik 7 maupun 4 merupakan suku konstanta.</para>
<para id="fs-id1170654943862">Baik <emphasis effect="italics">5x</emphasis> maupun 3<emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis> merupakan suku yang memuat <emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis>.</para>
<para id="fs-id1170654944183">Baik <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>n</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> maupun <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>n</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> merupakan suku yang memuat <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>n</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
<para id="fs-id1170655192776">Jika dua suku merupakan konstanta atau memiliki variabel dan eksponen yang sama, kita menyebut keduanya <emphasis effect="bold">suku sejenis</emphasis>.</para>
<list id="fs-id1166422559187" list-type="bulleted" bullet-style="bullet">
<item>7 dan 4 merupakan suku sejenis.</item>
<item>5<emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis> dan 3<emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis> merupakan suku sejenis.</item>
<item><m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>n</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> dan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>n</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> merupakan suku sejenis.</item>
</list>
<note id="fs-id1170654936881">
<title>Suku Sejenis</title>
<para id="fs-id1170654936541">Suku-suku yang semuanya merupakan konstanta atau memiliki variabel yang sama dengan pangkat yang sama disebut <term id="term-00021">suku sejenis</term>.</para>
</note>
<example id="fs-id1170654936780">
<exercise id="fs-id1170654936782">
<problem id="fs-id1170654936784">
<para id="fs-id1170654936786">Identifikasi suku-suku sejenis: <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> 14, 23, <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> 9<emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis>, <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655189504">
<title>Penyelesaian</title>
<para id="fs-id1170654942212"><m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> dan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> merupakan suku sejenis karena keduanya memuat <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>;</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> variabel dan eksponennya sama.</para>
<para id="fs-id1170654940949"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> dan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> merupakan suku sejenis karena keduanya memuat <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>;</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> variabel dan eksponennya sama.</para>
<para id="fs-id1170654935536">14 dan 23 merupakan suku sejenis karena keduanya adalah konstanta.</para>
<para id="fs-id1170655195762">Tidak ada suku lain yang sejenis dengan 9<emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis>.</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</example>
<note id="fs-id1170654932190" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170655163424">
<problem id="fs-id1170655163426">
<para id="fs-id1170655163428">Identifikasi suku-suku sejenis: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>15</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>11</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170654932121">
<para id="fs-id1170654936607">9 dan 15, <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> dan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>11</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> dan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id1170654942110" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170654942820">
<problem id="fs-id1170654942822">
<para id="fs-id1170654942824">Identifikasi suku-suku sejenis: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> 19, <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> 24, <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655162912">
<para id="fs-id1170654936398">19 dan 24, <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> dan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> dan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<para id="fs-id1170655174214">Menjumlahkan atau mengurangkan suku-suku membentuk suatu ekspresi. Dalam ekspresi <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> dari <link target-id="fs-id1170655171250" />, ketiga sukunya adalah <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> dan 8.</para>
<example id="fs-id1170654944433">
<exercise id="fs-id1170654944435">
<problem id="fs-id1170654940658">
<para id="fs-id1170654940660">Identifikasi suku-suku dalam setiap ekspresi.</para>
<list id="fs-id1166422654836" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled">
<item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>12</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></item>
<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>y</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math></item>
</list>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170654941538">
<title>Penyelesaian</title>
<list id="fs-id1166422254836" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> Suku-suku dari <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>12</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> adalah <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> 7<emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis>, dan 12.<newline /><newline />
</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> Suku-suku dari <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>y</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math> adalah 8<emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis> dan 3<emphasis effect="italics">y</emphasis>.</item></list>
</solution>
</exercise>
</example>
<note id="fs-id1170654944577" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170654944216">
<problem id="fs-id1170654944218">
<para id="fs-id1170654944220">Identifikasi suku-suku dalam ekspresi <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>17</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170654942970">
<para id="fs-id1170654942642"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>17</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id1170654943428" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170654943433">
<problem id="fs-id1170654943435">
<para id="fs-id1170654943822">Identifikasi suku-suku dalam ekspresi <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170654940732">
<para id="fs-id1170654940734">5<emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis>, 2<emphasis effect="italics">y</emphasis></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<para id="fs-id1170654943110">Jika suatu ekspresi memuat suku-suku sejenis, Anda dapat menyederhanakan ekspresi itu dengan menggabungkan suku-suku sejenis. Menurut Anda, <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math> dapat disederhanakan menjadi apa? Jika Anda menjawab 12<emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis>, Anda benar!</para>
<equation id="fs-id1170654940806" class="unnumbered"><label /><m:math><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mspace width="1em" /><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mspace width="1em" /><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:math></equation>
<para id="fs-id1170654936709">Jumlahkan koefisiennya dan pertahankan variabel yang sama. Nilai <emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis> tidak menjadi soal—jika Anda memiliki 4 benda, menambahkan 7 benda sejenis, lalu menambahkan 1 lagi, hasilnya adalah 12 benda. Misalnya, 4 jeruk ditambah 7 jeruk ditambah 1 jeruk sama dengan 12 jeruk. Sifat-sifat matematika yang mendasari hal ini akan kita bahas nanti.</para>
<para id="fs-id1170654940628">Sederhanakan: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
<para id="fs-id1170654936258">Jumlahkan koefisiennya. 12<emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis></para>
<example id="fs-id1170654940588">
<title>Cara Menggabungkan Suku Sejenis</title>
<exercise id="fs-id1170654940590">
<problem id="fs-id1170654940592">
<para id="fs-id1170654941823">Sederhanakan: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170654941968">
<title>Penyelesaian</title>
<media id="fs-id1170655224688" alt="Tiga baris petunjuk tercantum dalam kolom di sisi kiri gambar, sedangkan empat bentuk aljabar tercantum di kanan. Baris petunjuk pertama di kiri berbunyi: “Langkah 1. Identifikasi suku-suku sejenis.” Di seberang langkah 1 pada kolom kanan terdapat bentuk aljabar 2x kuadrat tambah 3x tambah 7 tambah x kuadrat tambah 4x tambah 5. Satu baris di bawahnya, ekspresi yang sama diulangi, tetapi setiap suku menggunakan salah satu dari tiga warna untuk menunjukkan suku-suku sejenis: 2x kuadrat dan x kuadrat berwarna merah; 3x dan 4x berwarna biru; 7 dan 5 berwarna hijau.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_014a_new.jpg" />
</media>
<media id="fs-id1170653192952" alt="Baris petunjuk kedua di kiri berbunyi: “Langkah 2. Susun ulang ekspresi agar suku-suku sejenis berdekatan.” Di seberang langkah 2 pada kolom kanan terdapat bentuk aljabar semula dengan susunan suku diubah sehingga suku-suku sejenis berdampingan: 2x kuadrat tambah x kuadrat, keduanya berwarna merah; ditambah 3x tambah 4x, keduanya berwarna biru; ditambah 7 tambah 5, keduanya berwarna hijau.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_014b_new.jpg" />
</media>
<media id="fs-id1170655041754" alt="Baris petunjuk ketiga di kiri berbunyi: “Langkah 3. Gabungkan suku-suku sejenis.” Di seberang langkah 3 pada kolom kanan terdapat bentuk aljabar setelah suku-suku sejenis digabungkan: 3x kuadrat berwarna merah, ditambah 7x berwarna biru, ditambah 12 berwarna hijau.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_014c_new.jpg" />
</media>
</solution>
</exercise>
</example>
<note id="fs-id1170655124954" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170655165458">
<problem id="fs-id1170655165461">
<para id="fs-id1170655165463">Sederhanakan: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170654944751">
<para id="fs-id1170654944753"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>16</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>17</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id1170655106279" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170655106283">
<problem id="fs-id1170655206781">
<para id="fs-id1170655206783">Sederhanakan: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170654924801">
<para id="fs-id1170654936363"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id1170655205372" class="howto">
<title>Gabungkan suku-suku sejenis.</title>
<list id="fs-id1166425014151" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="stepwise">
<item>Identifikasi suku-suku sejenis.</item>
<item>Susun ulang ekspresi agar suku-suku sejenis berdekatan.</item>
<item>Jumlahkan atau kurangkan koefisiennya dan pertahankan variabel yang sama untuk setiap kelompok suku sejenis.</item>
</list>
</note>
</section>
